    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148-a9">

                <pb facs="0398" n="280" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg280"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure A 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bates to Mr. Thurston.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Apia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1886-09-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 2,
                    1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I hand you, herewith inclosed, a copy of a
                    note which I have addrsssed to Mr. Travers under this date. I have endeavored to
                    state the position assumed by each of us in our relation to each other here, and
                    have ventured that I understand your views to correspond in substance with mine.
                    I should be glad to know from you if I have been correct in this statement.</p>
                <p>I have etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. H. Bates.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
